    "The candidate must compile against native OpenBW and official BWAPI 4.4 headers before launch.",
    "The emergency bridge is eligible only for a visible, detected, non-worker, attack-capable local Zerg threat while completed combat army is below two; it assigns at most two eligible Probes.",
